{"id":"vod_md_2626","vodId":"2626","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"凉宫春日的忧郁2006","name_cn":"凉宫春日的忧郁2006","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"14集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230817-1/c1a7b6395d599168675d620a9fa168b1.jpg"},"summary":"“我毕业于东中，叫做凉宫春日。我对普通的人类没有兴趣。你们之中要是有外星人、未来人、异世界人或者超能力者的话，就尽管来找我吧。”这是凉宫春日的宣言，也是她对于平庸生活的挑战。我们可能在很小时就不再相信圣诞老人的存在，也慢慢不会再对外星人，特异功能等等产生幻想。在生活的教化下习惯于平淡无奇的生活。可是不安于现状的凉宫同学却勇敢的建立起SOS团，用强烈的意志去试图改造这个了无新意的世界。她的忧郁，究竟从何而来，又将从何而去。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,科幻,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-17 08:02:51","classic":true,"classicRank":3,"franchise":"凉宫春日","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/kZFjJpYv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/Nftm9gYE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/dRbMB9X4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/TeaSqSia/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/qRHS2P8K/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/6XA2aaXL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/QIAupU94/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/p9pg4n5O/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/UIeyMZDW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/SRSCEuRm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/u74K7gOo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/grx2DoiX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/1Mo7g4cH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/LHB00OTY/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:01:48.875Z"}